  (text "NOTES\n- U1 (XIAO) and U3 (DFPlayer) plug into female header sockets so they stay removable.\n- Q1/Q2 are AO3400s on SOT-23 adapter boards, mounted flat on their pins. Footprint pads\n  follow the adapter's S-D-G order (adapter labels 2-3-1).\n- Off-board parts plug into JST-PH sockets: J1 GY-33 (pigtail soldered to its GND/DR/CT/VCC\n  holes, same order), J2 speaker, J3 wake button, J4 LiPo.\n- J4: battery polarity is not standard. Check each battery against the board's + mark first.\n- J5: two short wires to the XIAO's underside BAT+/BAT- pads. The XIAO's battery pads are\n  not on its headers, so this is how VBAT reaches the XIAO's charger." (at 30.48 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (thickness 0.25)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6d3307a6-5459-4406-a89d-91e15168294b)
  )

